<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Privacy Policy | <%= appName || "Immigration App" %></title>

  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/public/css/styles.css">
  <%- include('partials/header1.ejs') %>

  <style>
    .policy-wrap{
      max-width: 980px;
      margin: 40px auto;
      padding: 28px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.80);
      border-radius: 14px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.45);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);
      line-height: 1.55;
    }
    .policy-wrap h1{ margin-top: 0; }
    .policy-wrap h2{ margin-top: 26px; }
    .muted{ opacity: 0.85; }
    .meta{
      display:flex;
      gap:12px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin: 10px 0 18px;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }
    .pill{
      padding: 6px 10px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
      display:inline-block;
    }
    ul{ padding-left: 20px; }
    code{ background: rgba(0,0,0,0.06); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 6px; }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <%- include('partials/navbar.ejs') %>
      <!-- ⭐ UNIVERSAL Background -->
  <%- include('partials/globalBackground') %>


  <main class="policy-wrap">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

    <div class="meta">
      <span class="pill"><strong>Last updated:</strong> <%= lastUpdated || "INSERT DATE" %></span>
      <span class="pill"><strong>Version:</strong> <%= privacyVersion || "1.0" %></span>
      <span class="pill"><strong>Applies to:</strong> all users worldwide (NZ law applies)</span>
    </div>

    <p class="muted">
      This Privacy Policy explains how <strong><%= appName || "WelcomelyNZ" %></strong> (“we”, “us”, “our”) collects,
      uses, stores, and protects personal information. We operate in line with the <a href="https://www.legislation.govt.nz/act/public/2020/0031/latest/LMS23223.html"><strong>New Zealand Privacy Act 2020</strong></a>
      and the <a href="https://www.privacy.org.nz/privacy-principles/"><strong>Information Privacy Principles (IPPs)</strong></a>.
    </p>

    <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
    <p>
      This application supports immigration-related queries and communication between migrants, licensed immigration advisers,
      and administrators. Users may be located anywhere in the world.
    </p>

    <h2>2. Personal Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>We collect only information reasonably necessary to operate the application. This may include:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Account information:</strong> username and password (password stored in hashed form)</li>
      <li><strong>Contact details:</strong> email address (if collected)</li>
      <li><strong>User-submitted content:</strong> queries, submissions, and messages</li>
      <li><strong>Role information:</strong> e.g., migrant / adviser / administrator</li>
      <li><strong>Security logs:</strong> timestamps, session identifiers, IP address (for security/abuse prevention)</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Create and manage user accounts</li>
      <li>Authenticate users and maintain secure sessions</li>
      <li>Enable submission and review workflows</li>
      <li>Allow appropriate contact/communication features</li>
      <li>Maintain security and prevent unauthorised access</li>
      <li>Meet legal/regulatory obligations (NZ)</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. Storage and Security</h2>
    <p>
      We take reasonable steps to protect your personal information from loss, misuse, unauthorised access, disclosure, or modification.
      This includes access controls and storing passwords using secure hashing.
    </p>

    <h2>5. Access and Correction</h2>
    <p>
      Under IPPs 6 and 7, you may request access to personal information we hold about you and request corrections where appropriate.
    </p>

    <h2>6. Disclosure</h2>
    <p>We do not sell personal information. We disclose only when necessary to operate the app or where required by law.</p>

    <h2>7. International Users</h2>
    <p>
      Users may access this application outside New Zealand. By using the app you acknowledge processing/storage may occur in New Zealand
      or other jurisdictions, with reasonable steps taken to protect information consistent with NZ expectations.
    </p>

    <h2>8. Retention</h2>
    <p>
      We retain personal information only as long as necessary for operational and legal purposes. Data may be deleted or anonymised when no longer needed.
    </p>

    <h2>9. Cookies and Sessions</h2>
    <p>
      We use session cookies strictly for authentication and security. We do not use cookies for advertising.
    </p>

    <h2>10. Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p>We may update this policy. Updates will be posted within the application and take effect on publication.</p>

    <h2>11. Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Privacy requests/concerns: <strong><%= privacyContactEmail %></strong>
    </p>

    <h2>12. Complaints</h2>
    <p>
      If you believe your privacy rights have been breached, contact us first. You may also complain to the Office of the Privacy Commissioner (NZ).
    </p>

    <hr />
    <p class="muted">
  
    </p>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
